    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Tomasz K",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108271657465217354517/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX4jlxhmz4-txa5nGd19vumjsL06J4P2FLQjO1wLYIzuMfCrnU77Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 months ago",
        "text": "Walking into this theater is like time-traveling to 1998, minus dial-up internet and frosted tips. It's got that vintage charm, it's spotless, the staff are lovely, and they play English movies (because yes, I speak French, but Tom Cruise sounds weird dubbed). Plus, they have nachos. Instant 5 stars for that alone.",
        "time": 1753144734,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Gurpreet Kaur",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105913705782265652473/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWYyncPHJOfuEmTdV4YxQyo_KfAJvDOlHpnzoxgKyfd0h9C14P_bA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "7 months ago",
        "text": "Nice Small Theatre Experience 🎭🎬\n\nI recently visited the Théâtre in Vaudreuil-Dorion and had a pleasant experience. It’s a small and quiet theatre, which I actually liked — not too crowded, so it’s easy to relax and enjoy the movie.\n\nThe place was clean, and the staff was polite. It’s not a big, fancy cinema, but perfect for a peaceful outing without too much rush.\n\nGreat for locals or anyone looking for a calm movie night!",
        "time": 1751073627,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Gregory Leblanc",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100308272084751006968/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLrDAEk6ly44G8UJ__LOOI3RLBi7WJzi6wVgPm8wQBppNxJAw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 3,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "A charming old-school Cineplex with a cozy atmosphere. It features about six screens with a smaller number of seats, offering a more intimate movie-watching experience. However, note that screenings are only available in French, so it’s perfect for those fluent in or looking to immerse themselves in the language. While it may lack the amenities of larger theaters, its nostalgic vibe makes it a unique spot for catching a film!",
        "time": 1734644163,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Genevieve T",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109974470146729124444/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVi7iyagp_wte4eygUWvz1XiWrwKifTMc7WxwEkbta3R2YGeEM=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "No one to help in the front, the only person doing it all knows how to do nothing!! An employee accused us of stealing… Terrible place!  Seats are busted, carpets are dirty and washrooms broken! I really hope this place shuts down to make room for a newer nicer place!",
        "time": 1735324543,
        "translated": false
      },
